  "term_and_condition": "<div style=\"font-family: Poppins;\"><h3 data-path-to-node=\"2\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Helvetica; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-line: none; text-decoration-thickness: auto; text-decoration-style: solid;\" id=\"isPasted\"><b data-path-to-node=\"2\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Atletix Horse – Affiliate Terms &amp; Conditions</b></h3><p data-path-to-node=\"3\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Helvetica; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-line: none; text-decoration-thickness: auto; text-decoration-style: solid;\">By joining the Atletix Horse Affiliate Program, you agree to adhere to the following terms and conditions. These rules are designed to protect our brand and ensure a professional, fair, and legally compliant partnership.</p><p data-path-to-node=\"4\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Helvetica; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-line: none; text-decoration-thickness: auto; text-decoration-style: solid;\"><b data-path-to-node=\"4\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">1. FTC Disclosure Requirements</b><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span>Per FTC (Federal Trade Commission) guidelines, you must clearly and conspicuously disclose your relationship with Atletix Horse in any post, video, or verbal recommendation. You must use tags like<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span><b data-path-to-node=\"4\" data-index-in-node=\"228\">#ad</b><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span>or<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span><b data-path-to-node=\"4\" data-index-in-node=\"235\">#sponsored</b>, or explicitly state:<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span><i data-path-to-node=\"4\" data-index-in-node=\"268\">\"I earn a commission if you purchase through my link/code.\"</i></p><p data-path-to-node=\"5\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Helvetica; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-line: none; text-decoration-thickness: auto; text-decoration-style: solid;\"><b data-path-to-node=\"5\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">2. No Medical Claims</b><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span>You are strictly prohibited from stating or implying that Atletix Horse products can \"cure,\" \"treat,\" \"diagnose,\" or \"prevent\" any disease (e.g., laminitis, navicular disease, or arthritis). All claims must focus on supporting the horse's general health, wellbeing, and performance, consistent with the language on our official website.</p><p data-path-to-node=\"6\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Helvetica; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-line: none; text-decoration-thickness: auto; text-decoration-style: solid;\"><b data-path-to-node=\"6\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">3. No Self-Referrals</b><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span>You are not permitted to use your own affiliate link or code to purchase products for yourself. Such orders will be flagged and the commission will be voided. If you wish to purchase products for your own horses, please visit our website and use the code<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span><b data-path-to-node=\"6\" data-index-in-node=\"276\">ATLETIX15</b><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span>at checkout for a 15% personal discount as a thank you for being a part of our team.</p><p data-path-to-node=\"7\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Helvetica; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-line: none; text-decoration-thickness: auto; text-decoration-style: solid;\"><b data-path-to-node=\"7\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">4. Accurate Representation &amp; Code of Conduct</b><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span>You must represent Atletix Horse in a professional and ethical manner. Any content that is deemed offensive, deceptive, or harmful to our brand reputation will result in immediate removal from the program. All partners are required to adhere to the<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span><b data-path-to-node=\"7\" data-index-in-node=\"294\">Atletix Horse Code of Conduct</b>, which outlines our core values and standards for professional behavior in the equestrian community.</p><p data-path-to-node=\"8\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Helvetica; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-line: none; text-decoration-thickness: auto; text-decoration-style: solid;\"><b data-path-to-node=\"8\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">5. No Brand Bidding (PPC)</b><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span>You may not bid on \"Atletix Horse,\" \"Atletix,\" or any variation of our trademarked name on search engines (Google Ads, Bing Ads, etc.). This ensures you do not compete with our official marketing efforts and helps maintain fair advertising costs.</p><p data-path-to-node=\"9\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Helvetica; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-line: none; text-decoration-thickness: auto; text-decoration-style: solid;\"><b data-path-to-node=\"9\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">6. Tax Compliance (W-9)</b><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span>For legal and tax purposes, all U.S.-based affiliates are required to provide a valid Form W-9 before any commission is paid out. No payments will be processed for accounts exceeding $600 in annual earnings until tax documentation is verified and on file.</p><p data-path-to-node=\"10\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Helvetica; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-line: none; text-decoration-thickness: auto; text-decoration-style: solid;\"><b data-path-to-node=\"10\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">7. Spam &amp; Unsolicited Outreach</b><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span>Mass emailing, comment spamming on social media, or any form of unsolicited commercial communication (spam) is strictly prohibited and will lead to immediate account termination.</p><p data-path-to-node=\"11\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Helvetica; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-line: none; text-decoration-thickness: auto; text-decoration-style: solid;\"><b data-path-to-node=\"11\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">8. Payment and Holding Period</b><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span>Commissions are subject to a 30-day holding period to account for potential returns or order cancellations. Payments are issued via PayPal once the minimum payout threshold has been met and the holding period has expired.</p></div>",
